{"id":"623497","name":"凉拌韭菜","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"","cover":"images/623497/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"嫩韭菜","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"蒜末和小米椒圈","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"耗油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"香醋","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"韭菜用盐水清洗，洗去农药残留。","img":"images/623497/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中加水放入食盐。","img":"images/623497/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入食用油（这样，焯烫的韭菜才会碧绿鲜亮）。","img":"images/623497/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"下入韭菜焯烫。","img":"images/623497/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"过凉攥干水分后，用刀拦腰切两半。","img":"images/623497/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将韭菜装入盘中加入蒜蓉和小米椒圈。","img":"images/623497/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入食盐。","img":"images/623497/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入白糖。","img":"images/623497/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入鸡精。","img":"images/623497/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/623497/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋入热油。","img":"images/623497/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入生抽。","img":"images/623497/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入耗油。","img":"images/623497/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入香醋。","img":"images/623497/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"搅拌均匀后即可食用。","img":"images/623497/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}